%% Example of what a reviewing agent might emit for a change.
flowchart LR
  subgraph App["diffr app"]
    Review[Review panel] --> Render[Diagram view]
  end
  Agent([AI agent]) -->|emits mermaid| Check{check-diagram}
  Check -->|ok| Render
  Check -->|error + line/col| Agent
  Render --> Svg[(SVG cache)]
  Legacy[ASCII preview]
  class Render,Check added
  Review:::changed
  class Legacy removed
